<ui-doc-example id="plain-classes" title="Plain classes" description="The same structure written by hand: a button with popovertarget and a dnf-dropdown__menu with popover and the menu role. The ids must match and be unique.">
    <div class="dnf-dropdown">
        <button type="button" class="dnf-button dnf-button--ghost dnf-button--sm dnf-button--icon-only" popovertarget="docs-menu-plain"
                aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Actions for hero.jpg"><dnf-icon name="more" size="Sm" /></button>
        <div class="dnf-dropdown__menu" id="docs-menu-plain" popover role="menu" aria-label="Actions for hero.jpg" data-placement="bottom-end">
            <div class="dnf-dropdown__label" role="presentation">Image</div>
            <a class="dnf-dropdown__item" role="menuitem" href="/admin/media"><dnf-icon name="eye" /> Preview</a>
            <button type="button" class="dnf-dropdown__item" role="menuitem"><dnf-icon name="pencil" /> Rename</button>
            <div class="dnf-dropdown__separator" role="separator"></div>
            <button type="button" class="dnf-dropdown__item dnf-dropdown__item--danger" role="menuitem"><dnf-icon name="trash" /> Delete</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</ui-doc-example>

<h3 id="posting">Items that post</h3>
<p><code>&lt;dnf-dropdown-post&gt;</code> renders a <code>&lt;form method="post"&gt;</code> with the antiforgery token, a hidden input
    per <code>field-*</code> attribute and a submit item; <code>confirm*</code> attributes become the form's
    <code>data-confirm*</code>, so the <a href="@UiDocsCatalog.Root/components/dialog">confirmation dialog</a> asks first. (Not
    live here: this page posts nowhere.)</p>
<ui-doc-code id="posting-code" lang="razor">
<dnf-dropdown label="Actions for @@role.Name">
    <dnf-dropdown-link href="/admin/roles/@@role.Id" icon="pencil">Edit</dnf-dropdown-link>
    <dnf-dropdown-post action="/admin/roles/@@role.Id/duplicate" icon="copy">Duplicate</dnf-dropdown-post>
    <dnf-dropdown-separator />
    <dnf-dropdown-post action="/admin/roles/@@role.Id/delete" icon="trash" danger="true" field-returnTo="list"
                       confirm="Delete the role?" confirm-title="Delete role" confirm-action="Delete role">Delete</dnf-dropdown-post>
</dnf-dropdown>
</ui-doc-code>

